    pr_ref:  # cacb
    description: "In the Java/C bakeoff cohort (guacamole-client, guacamole-server-main, tmux), all entrypoints selected are bash scripts (generate-licenses.sh, entrypoint.sh, guacget, guacctl, regress/format-strings.sh). No C main() or Java servlet/controller entrypoints appear. This causes: (1) zero forward slices because bash scripts have no outgoing call edges, (2) reverse-slice seeds are bash utilities instead of production C/Java symbols, (3) the entire bakeoff assessment for these repos is uninformative. Root cause likely in entrypoint detection: bash scripts may rank higher than C main() or Java framework entrypoints."  # cacb
    fields: {}  # cacb
