  message: "Root cause found: _TEST_PATH_RE in bakeoff-features matched /spec as a substring of /special_repos/ (the pool directory path). Every entrypoint was filtered out, producing zero forward slices for ALL repos. Fix: require trailing / for directory-name patterns. PR pending."  # 4eb9
